:10,"updatedAt":11,"event_categories":12,"image":21},"跟著大師看建築～演化中的棚屋樓廈","\u003Cp\u003E分享嘉賓\u003Cbr\u003E朱競翔教授&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E- 香港中文大學建築學院副教授\u003Cbr\u003E- 《華爾街日報》中文版「中國創新人物獎」2012年得主\u003Cbr\u003E- 2015年香港建造業議會創新獎一等獎得主\u003Cbr\u003E- 第15屆威尼斯國際建築雙年展中國館「斗室」主設計師\u003Cbr\u003E- 創製的輕量建築，已落地300餘次，分佈全球多個地區，足跡遍及海拔4000米的玉樹高原，以至肯尼亞貧民區與菲律賓衝浪勝地\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E分享重點\u003Cbr\u003E- 顛覆現有建造方式的輕量建築，與傳統何干？\u003Cbr\u003E- 中、美、日、歐的建築風格，各有甚麼樣的來源？\u003Cbr\u003E- 這位建築師眼中，香港最佳的空間竟是這個商場與這個公屋？！\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E日期：9月20日（星期五）\u003Cbr\u003E時間：晚上7:30-9:00\u003Cbr\u003E地點：旺角登打士街56號家樂坊15樓安利體驗館會議室，Zoom同步線上直播\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$40\u003Cbr\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2024-09-20",null,"prof-Zhu-Jingxiang-2024","2024-09-14T08:33:44.271Z","2024-09-14T08:45:11.806Z",{"data":13},[14],{"id":15,"attributes":16},2,{"name":17,"slug":18,"description":8,"createdAt":19,"updatedAt":20},"名人面對面","be-our-guest","2023-02-12T02:38:55.942Z","2023-03-08T13:16:12.875Z",{"data":22},{"id":23,"attributes":24},50,{"name":25,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":26,"height":27,"formats":28,"hash":58,"ext":30,"mime":33,"size":59,"url":60,"previewUrl":8,"provider":61,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":62,"updatedAt":62},"Screenshot 2024-09-14 at 4.04.22 PM.png",2400,1800,{"large":29,"small":38,"medium":45,"thumbnail":51},{"ext":30,"url":31,"hash":32,"mime":33,"name":34,"path":8,"size":35,"width":36,"height":37},".png","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_Screenshot_2024_09_14_at_4_04_22_PM_7f423aef0a.png","large_Screenshot_2024_09_14_at_4_04_22_PM_7f423aef0a","image\u002Fpng","large_Screenshot 2024-09-14 at 4.04.22 PM.png",626.41,1000,750,{"ext":30,"url":39,"hash":40,"mime":33,"name":41,"path":8,"size":42,"width":43,"height":44},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_Screenshot_2024_09_14_at_4_04_22_PM_7f423aef0a.png","small_Screenshot_2024_09_14_at_4_04_22_PM_7f423aef0a","small_Screenshot 2024-09-14 at 4.04.22 PM.png",214.23,5