76466790904915308_n_331aad95ad","image\u002Fjpeg","large_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n.jpg",81.25,716,{"ext":224,"url":232,"hash":233,"mime":227,"name":234,"path":8,"size":235,"width":43,"height":236},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad.jpg","small_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad","small_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n.jpg",32.33,358,{"ext":224,"url":238,"hash":239,"mime":227,"name":240,"path":8,"size":241,"width":37,"height":242},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad.jpg","medium_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad","medium_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n.jpg",56.22,537,{"ext":224,"url":244,"hash":245,"mime":227,"name":246,"path":8,"size":247,"width":248,"height":57},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad.jpg","thumbnail_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad","thumbnail_428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n.jpg",8.96,218,"428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad",119.65,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002F428042708_780822640745440_8576466790904915308_n_331aad95ad.jpg","2024-02-11T04:52:46.576Z",{"id":254,"attributes":255},186,{"title":256,"content":257,"start_date":258,"excerpt":259,"slug":260,"end_date":8,"tags":8,"createdAt":261,"updatedAt":261,"event_categories":262,"image":266},"《2024樓市前瞻》","\u003Cp\u003E名人面對面：《2024樓市前瞻》\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E分享嘉賓：\u003Cbr\u003E團結香港基金副總裁 葉文祺先生\u003Cbr\u003ERyan其他資歷：\u003Cbr\u003E- 招商局置地有限公司獨立非執行董事\u003Cbr\u003E- 香港政府北部都會區諮詢委員會委員、土地及建設諮詢委員會委員\u003Cbr\u003E- 曾於仲量聯行及香港金融管理局擔任經濟師\u003Cbr\u003E- 倫敦政治經濟學院經濟學碩士\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERyan領導團結香港基金的專業研究團隊，在土地供應、房屋市場、城市規劃、房地產科技、宜居城市等議題進行深入研究，並為香港政府提供政策建議；曾受邀於不同投資論壇及專業研討會中擔任講者，亦經常接受不同媒體訪問。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E💡在美國預計減息，新樓潛在供應在高位徘徊，減辣效應不彰等因素影響下，香港樓價何去何從？上車、換樓或投資，何時是良機？\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：2024年2月5日(星期一)\u003Cbr\u003E時間：晚上7:30-8:45\u003Cbr\u003E地點：旺角登打士街56號家樂坊安利體驗館會議室，Zoom同步直播\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$40\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"\u003E報名：請傳電郵到aksempowerhk@gmail.com 或在 Facebook.com\u002Fempower.hk 給我們Messanger 訊息。謝謝！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2024-02-05","團結香港基金副總裁 葉文祺先生","Ryan_240205","2023-12-17T02:41:05.210Z",{"data":263},[264],{"id":15,"attributes":265},{"name":17,"slug":18,"description":8,"createdAt":19,"updatedAt":20},{"data":267},{"id":268,"attributes":269},36,{"name":270,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":26,"height":27,"formats":271,"hash":292,"ext":30,"mime":33,"size":293,"url":294,"previewUrl":8,"provider":61,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":295,"updatedAt":295},"Screenshot 2023-12-15 at 4.30.54 PM.png",{"large":272,"small":277,"medium":282,"thumbnail":287},{"ext":30,"url":273,"hash":274,"mime":33,"name":275,"path":8,"size":276,"width":36,"height":37},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_Screenshot_2023_12_15_at_4_30_54_PM_8f46c14de4.png","large_Screenshot_2023_12_15_at_4_30_54_PM_8f46c14de4","large_Screenshot 2023-12-15 at 4.30.54 PM.png",593.91,{"ext":30,"url":278,"hash":279,"mime":33,"name":280,"path":8,"size":281,"width":43,"height":44},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_Scree