行山時間為3小時）\u003Cbr\u003E由朗屏集合坐K66巴士預計半小時，由掃管笏往黃金海岸約需20分鐘。\u003Cbr\u003E備註：水泥路面，輕鬆易走\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：1\u002F1\u002F2024 星期一\u003Cbr\u003E時間：9:30-15:30&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E集合地點：早上9:30在朗屏港鐵站B出口\u003Cbr\u003E預計最遲2點到三聖村午飯\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"\u003E報名：請傳電郵到empowerhkinfo@gmail.com 或 在 Facebook.com\u002Fempower.hk 給我們Messanger 訊息。謝謝！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2024-01-01","TaiLamChungReservoir-240101","2023-12-11T06:45:45.956Z",{"data":344},[345],{"id":162,"attributes":346},{"name":164,"slug":165,"description":8,"createdAt":166,"updatedAt":166},{"data":348},{"id":349,"attributes":350},34,{"name":351,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":26,"height":172,"formats":352,"hash":373,"ext":30,"mime":33,"size":374,"url":375,"previewUrl":8,"provider":61,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":376,"updatedAt":376},"Screenshot 2023-11-14 at 6.57.08 PM.png",{"large":353,"small":358,"medium":363,"thumbnail":368},{"ext":30,"url":354,"hash":355,"mime":33,"name":356,"path":8,"size":357,"width":36,"height":179},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_Screenshot_2023_11_14_at_6_57_08_PM_19f0061412.png","large_Screenshot_2023_11_14_at_6_57_08_PM_19f0061412","large_Screenshot 2023-11-14 at 6.57.08 PM.png",565.61,{"ext":30,"url":359,"hash":360,"mime":33,"name":361,"path":8,"size":362,"width":43,"height":185},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_Screenshot_2023_11_14_at_6_57_08_PM_19f0061412.png","small_Screenshot_2023_11_14_at_6_57_08_PM_19f0061412","small_Screenshot 2023-11-14 at 6.57.08 PM.png",160.45,{"ext":30,"url":364,"hash":365,"mime":33,"name":366,"path":8,"size":367,"width":37,"height":191},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_Screenshot_2023_11_14_at_6_57_08_PM_19f0061412.png","medium_Screenshot_2023_11_14_at_6_57_08_PM_19f0061412","medium_Screenshot 2023-11-14 at 6.57.08 PM.png",333.2,{"ext":30,"url":369,"hash":370,"mime":33,