16\u002F1f342.png\" alt=\"🍂\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E平時侷促在辦公室及煩囂市區，放假一於逃離市區抖抖氣！\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft81\u002F2\u002F16\u002F1f6b6.png\" alt=\"🚶\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E今次我地探訪環境清幽的屯門藍地水塘。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E藍地水塘建於1957年，為灌溉水塘之一，水塘雖小，但環境清幽風景如畫。.\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E由屯門市出發，沿途風光明媚，途中可以俯瞰屯門市景色，並經過富有特色的\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ftb2\u002F2\u002F16\u002F1f308.png\" alt=\"🌈\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E七色彩虹欄杆。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E行完山，一齊在嶺大校園內酒樓食埋晏先走！\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft78\u002F2\u002F16\u002F1f35c.png\" alt=\"🍜\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E今次登山路線：屯門何福堂 》 麥徑十段 》 屯門徑二段 》 沿藍地水塘到大水壩 》 虎地下村\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E（預計行山時間為3小時）\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E備註：大部分為石屎路，當中有比較多樓梯上落，但樓梯狀況良好。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E日期：4\u002F11\u002F2023 星期六\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E時間：9:30-14:30（若不午餐，預計13:00到嶺南大學）\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E集合地點：屯門西鐵站 A出口杯渡路（9:30）\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft76\u002F2\u002F16\u002F1f35a.png\" alt=\"🍚\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E午餐: 嶺南大學酒樓 (暫定13:00-14:00)，若不午餐，請報名時註明，以便訂枱。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2023-11-04","Lam-Tei-Reservoir-2304","2023-11-08T08:18:10.926Z",{"data":429},[430],{"id":162,"attributes":431},{"name":164,"slug":165,"description":8,"createdAt":166,"updatedAt":166},{"data":433},{"id":434,"attributes":435},31,{"name":436,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":220,"height":437,"formats":438,"hash":460,"ext":224,"mime":227,"size":461,"url":462,"previewUrl":8,"provider":61,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":463,"updatedAt":463},"397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_n.jpg",1153,{"large":439,"small":444,"medium":449,"thumbnail":454},{"ext":224,"url":440,"hash":441,"mime":227,"name":442,"path":8,"size":443,"width":36,"height":179},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_n_f816c4190c.jpg","large_397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_n_f816c4190c","large_397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_n.jpg",68.54,{"ext":224,"url":445,"hash":446,"mime":227,"name":447,"path":8,"size":448,"width":43,"height":185},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_n_f816c4190c.jpg","small_397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_n_f816c4190c","small_397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_n.jpg",26.76,{"ext":224,"url":450,"hash":451,"mime":227,"name":452,"path":8,"size":453,"width":37,"height":318},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_397206216_717852507042454_7126349618132211877_